OL,3,AUK announces sanctions on Israeli
OL,4,Asettlements in West Bank and accuses
OL,5,Asettlers of 'ethnic cleansing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband confirms
OL,8,Fthe UK will ban the import of goods
OL,9,Ffrom Israeli settlements in the
OL,10,Fillegally occupied West Bank - here's
OL,11,Fwhat else he said
OL,13,FSpeaking in Parliament, Miliband says
OL,14,F"ethnic cleansing" is being carried out
OL,15,Fby "settler terrorists" and accuses the
OL,16,FIsraeli government of turning a "blind
OL,17,Feye"
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
