OL,3,APrince George begins first day at a
OL,4,Arainy Eton College
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrince George arrived on a rainy
OL,7,Fmorning for his first day at Eton
OL,8,FCollege, accompanied by his father and
OL,9,Fmother, the Prince and Princess of
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FPrince William and Catherine carried
OL,13,Fumbrellas as they brought George,
OL,14,Fwearing a jacket and tie, to be
OL,15,Fwelcomed by the head teacher, Simon
OL,16,FHenderson, and provost Sir Nicholas
OL,17,FColeridge.
OL,19,F"Welcome, good luck and enjoy," said
OL,20,Fthe head teacher, shaking hands with
OL,21,FPrince George.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/41
